@@ -27,6 +27,20 @@ npm run preview
 
 Portfolio copy, links, skills, and project cards live in `src/data/profile.ts`.
 
+## Visual Preferences
+
+The backdrop variant and color theme are stored together in localStorage under
+`tahion.visual.preferences` as a version `1` record with `variant` and `theme`
+fields. On first load, the app reads the legacy raw-string keys
+`tahion.backdrop.variant` and `tahion.backdrop.theme` independently, defaults
+missing or invalid choices to `signal` and `acid`, and migrates any valid legacy
+choice without changing the old keys. A malformed or unsupported current record
+is ignored in favor of defaults and is not overwritten.
+
+Open tabs listen for changes to the current record. Valid records update both
+controls, removing the record resets both defaults, and remote changes are not
+written back. Storage failures leave the controls usable in memory.
+
 ## Deployment
 
